<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hanwha Energy 1997 turnaround schedule.</title>
<headline>Hanwha Energy 1997 turnaround schedule.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hanwha Energy Co Ltd on Monday disclosed its schedule for annual maintenance closure of its crude distillation units (CDUs) in 1997 (capacity in barrels per day):</p>
<p>	CDU		    CAPACITY	 CLOSURE SCHEDULE</p>
<p>    Inchon 1		  75,000	  Sept 20-Oct 23</p>
<p>    Inchon 2		 200,000	  May 23-June 25</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
